{#
  Catalog PDF chrome — the shared CSS every archetype includes inside its
  <style> (#2608): page anatomy, ink/hairline constants, the fixed footer, the
  framed cover panel and the small-caps eyebrow utility.

  Expects the Twig vars set at the top of each archetype template:
  c_accent / c_accent_dark / c_on_accent / c_on_accent_dark / c_zebra /
  c_panel (palette) and l (labels map).

  Dompdf-safe CSS only (CSS 2.1 subset + border-radius): no flex/grid, no CSS
  custom properties, no gradients. The cover is deliberately FRAMED by the
  page margins (a gallery-frame look) instead of full-bleed: position:fixed
  chrome prints on every page including the first, so a full-bleed cover
  would collide with the footer — framing sidesteps that entire class of
  artefacts and reads as intent.
#}
@page {
    margin: 44px 40px 58px 40px;
}
body {
    font-family: 'Inter', 'DejaVu Sans', sans-serif;
    color: #16181d;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 11px;
}
.page-footer {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: -40px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    border-top: 0.75px solid #e3e5e9;
    padding-top: 6px;
    font-size: 7.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9aa0a8;
}
.page-footer .pf-right {
    float: right;
}
.page-footer .pagenum:after {
    content: counter(page);
}
.eyebrow {
    font-size: 8.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ c_accent }};
}
.cover {
    page-break-after: always;
}
.cover-panel {
    {# 1021px of A4 content height minus 2x64px padding, with slack so the
       panel never spills a solid-colour second page. #}
    background-color: {{ c_accent_dark }};
    color: {{ c_on_accent_dark }};
    height: 872px;
    padding: 64px 56px;
}
.cover-brand {
    width: 100%;
}
.cover-brand .cover-company {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ c_on_accent_dark }};
}
.cover-brand .cover-logo-chip {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    text-align: center;
}
.cover-brand .cover-logo-chip img {
    max-height: 44px;
    max-width: 150px;
}
.cover-spacer {
    height: 470px;
}
.cover-kicker {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.cover-title {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'DejaVu Serif', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 50px;
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 0 0 26px 0;
}
.cover-rule {
    width: 64px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid {{ c_on_accent_dark }};
    margin-bottom: 22px;
}
.cover-meta {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
}
